<p>Builder at $25–$40 per month for thirty-six months is $900–$1,440 before apps. Simple Website at $450 plus $15 per month hosting might land under $1,000 with fewer performance headaches. Business Website at $1,200 one-time fits when you need booking and print — still compare to builder e-commerce tiers if you sell online.</p>
