<p>Squarespace commerce fits small SKU counts. Large inventories may still need Shopify. Restaurants sometimes keep PDF menus — I prefer HTML sections for accessibility and SEO. Business Website tier handles moderate menu and booking combos; growth tier handles odd integrations.</p>

